# ── AI tooling scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Agent settings, job scratch dirs, and the git worktrees agents run in. None of
# it describes the product, and the worktrees are whole checkouts -- committing
# them would nest the repo inside itself.
.claude/

# Plans, architecture reviews and other skill output. These are working notes
# for a session, not project documentation: docs/design/ and docs/runbooks/ are
# the documents that belong in the repo, and they stay tracked.
docs/superpowers/
architecture-review-*.html

# Agent transcripts.
*.jsonl
